---
---
<div class="process">
    <h2>The Path to Clarity</h2>
    
    <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <strong>Discovery Call</strong>
            <p>A free 20-minute screening conversation to determine fit and identify the clinical tier you need.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <strong>Recommendation</strong>
            <p>Within 24 hours, I provide a written proposal based on the complexity and urgency of your case.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="step no-border">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <strong>Engagement</strong>
            <p>Immediate clinical onboarding, record review, and coordination with your medical team.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .process h2 {
        font-size: 2.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .step {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 3rem;
    }

    /* The vertical timeline indicator line */
    .step::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 7px;
        top: 25px;
        width: 1px;
        height: calc(100% + 1rem);
        background: #ddd;
    }

    .step.no-border::before {
        display: none;
    }

    .step-num {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 0;
        background: var(--bg-beige);
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .step-content strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--navy);
    }

    .step-content p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Responsive scaling */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .process h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .step {
            padding-left: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>